#
# The C++ headers of espos_flow, in Google style -- 2-space indent, `Type* p`,
# 80 columns -- like espos_n2k, espos_voice and espos_audio. The C half
# (src/, include/espos_flow.h, include/espos_sched.h) keeps the 4-space IDF
# look of the root .clang-format; clang-format uses the nearest file, which is
# why the two halves sit in different directories. The same file is in cpp/.
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
# Include order is deliberate: the component's own header first, then the
# espOS headers it depends on, then the system and IDF ones. Google's
# regrouping would move e.g. "espos_flow.h" below <cstdint>; never reorder.
SortIncludes: Never
